    "CURRIMUS" : {

    },
    "Currimus estimates a finish from your training, and that model is fitted on the marathon — over a shorter race it would be a number without evidence. Your goal time and required pace above are yours, and they stand." : {

    },
    "Currimus measures what it can and models the rest. Where it models, it says whose work it is using — here and on the screen that shows the number." : {

    },
    "Currimus reads your max heart rate and your resting heart rate from Apple Health every time it opens, and rebuilds the boundaries from them — fitness moves, and zones built on last year's numbers describe last year's runner. Max is the highest believable daily peak of the past year, resting is Health's own 60-day average, and the five zones split the span between them at 50 / 60 / 70 / 80 / 90 %, which is the model the Fitness app uses." : {

    },
    "Currimus records your run as an Apple Health workout. Distance and heart rate come from there, so without access there is nothing to record." : {

